      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My sister studying abroad in Paldea told me\nBergmite fight with Frigibax...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And the outdoors? Starting fires? That sounds so\ndangerous!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200074006800650020006F007500740064006F006F00720073003F0020005300740061007200740069006E0067002000660069007200650073003F0020005400680061007400200073006F0075006E0064007300200073006F000A00640061006E006700650072006F00750073002100100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Also, isn’t Zangoose that scary Pokémon that’s\nalways feuding with Seviper?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, but I think I’m going to give up on looking\nfor friends for Frigibax...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for talking to all those Trainers—\nsomething my introverted self could never do.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BABAX!!!",
